@startuml main-flow
' The main flow, from a student's edit to the change being live (FR-011, FR-014 to FR-017).
' Each step names the class that does it, as in docs/viva/README.md "Three flows, file by file".
' A swimlane is who acts; the notes are the slice and the store each step touches.
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Noto Sans
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #EAF2FB
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #3C7FC0
skinparam SwimlaneTitleFontStyle bold

title Exchange Student Guide — an edit, from the student to the published article

|Student (no account)|
start
:Searches "FRRO registration";
note right: search — Lucene through\nHibernate Search (FR-007)
:Reads the article, follows a ~[~[wiki link]];
note right: articleview, wikilink (FR-001, FR-002)
:Proposes an edit: Markdown with a live\npreview, tags, a photo;
note right: contribute — SubmissionForm\n(editor.js, tags.js, files.js)

|contribute slice|
:Rate limit: five submissions an hour;
:SubmissionService checks title, summary,\nbody, address and title collision;
if (refused?) then (yes)
  |Student (no account)|
  :Sees the error beside the field;
  note right: SubmissionRejectedException\nnames its Field
  stop
else (no)
  |contribute slice|
endif
:Saves the Submission; Tags.named,\nMediaAssets.attach (photo re-encoded);
note right: database: submission, tag\nmedia root: the photo's bytes
:Issues a number SUB-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX;
note right: the article itself is unchanged:\nnothing is public until approved

|OGE moderator|
:Signs in (shared password, 10 tries\nper 15 minutes per visitor);
:Opens the queue, oldest first;
:Reviews the edit as a diff of the text\nas it reads, with the photo;
note right: moderate — TextDiff
if (decision) then (reject)
  :Writes an optional reason;
  |moderate slice|
  :Submission rejected; its files\ndeleted a week later;
  |Student (no account)|
  :Looks up the number: sees the reason;
  stop
else (approve)
  |OGE moderator|
  :Adjusts summary and tags;
endif

|moderate slice|
:ModerationService.approve: the old text\nsaved as a Revision, the Article updated;
:MediaAssets.moveToArticle;
:Publishes ArticleTextChanged;
fork
  :backlink re-reads the article's links\n("What links here", red links);
fork again
  :Hibernate Search updates the index\nwhen the transaction commits;
end fork

|Student (no account)|
:The change is live, and search finds it;
stop
@enduml
